Author: ZhangTingan <ZhangTingan@uniontech.com>
Date:   Tue Apr 28 18:49:29 2026 +0800
Subject: support IVS shaping in QTextLayout

Pass variation selectors through the Qt font engine glyph lookup so
that QTextLayout can resolve IVS (Ideographic Variation Sequence)
glyphs correctly.

